{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_tuye_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_tuye_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"沙漠之虹","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tuye_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3f82c12b605c2408942415978612082680b349e38ba593c1b7f1be0645f5c792","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"图耶想要在一个干旱的小镇打一口井，可事情的发展，远超她的预料。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揉眼睛）怎么了？发生什么了......车怎么突然停了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐你醒了，不好意思，前面突然跑来一个抱着孩子的女人，我只能急刹车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没撞到他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，刹车很及时，不过她手里拿的好像是......一个碗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，水......咳咳咳，我的孩子已经两天没有喝水了，你可怜可怜我，给我一点水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，要水喝就要水喝，带着孩子拦疾驰而过的车就不怕被卷到车轮底下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你们发发善心，我们也是实在没办法了，就给几口水喝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，你看那孩子，嘴唇干裂......看着快要渴死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，女士，这几袋水你拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"给这、这么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的你够喝就行，我可以只在必要时饮水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么能行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都说了没关系了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得这附近有个小镇，你们是从那儿来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"连续两年旱灾，镇子里没下过一滴雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里的井呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"都干涸了，从井里提上来的只有黄黄的沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么严重的灾情，本地的长官就没有什么作为吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"他不像别人一样收拾东西跑路就不错了，还能指望他做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果都这样了，换个地方过，又会差到哪里去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"故土难离......不是说说而已，未成家的年轻人说走也就走了，像我这样拖家带口的女人能去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......是我失言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没关系。说不定熬到明年就下雨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明年就一定会有雨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"雨总会来的，或迟或早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或迟或早，及时就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，人生得不逢时，又怎能奢求雨来得及时呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔，我们和本舰预定好的汇合日期是在哪一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"还早，至少还有一个月，任务是提前做完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这里能留多长时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"最多半个月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（跳下车）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你们的镇子是在哪个方向，带路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，你这是去干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打井！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去打一口井！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一路走来，镇子里到处破败不堪，没想到这镇长的府邸修得倒是气派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想不到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这......倒也是，一处见不到花销，那必然花到另一处了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小丫头，你不长眼睛吗？这下可怎么办，水洒了一地，我的家里人都等着喝水呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，对不起，图耶小姐不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，老人家，别发脾气了，这袋水赔给你成吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收下吧，是我走路没看路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"异乡人，你真的要把它赔给我吗？要是拿去镇子上叫卖，至少能换七个金币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七个金币？你在开玩笑吗？恐怕加上这个水袋也值不了七个金币。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"光是换这坛浑水，就花了我五个金币，你这袋水这样清澈，价格肯定更高。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（蹲下身查看坛子碎片中的残水）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样脏的水也是可以饮用的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小丫头，你觉得我们还有别的选择吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，久等了，镇长先生请您进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怒气冲冲的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你来找那家伙吗？那我只能祝你好运了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这话什么意思啊，老夫人？喂！老夫人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，纳吉尔，别喊了，早走远了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，您好，我是本镇的镇长，代表镇民欢迎您的到来，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，握手就不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，图耶小姐真是个性十足啊。贾米尔，还不给尊贵的客人把水端上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，纳吉尔先生，请用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（面不改色喝下一大口）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（图耶小姐，这水真的可以喝吗？跟那坛水一样，都是又浑又黄。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"二位请不要因为杯子里的水浑浊不堪就觉得我们待客不周，实不相瞒，这是镇子里唯一打得出水的井了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然还有水喝，为什么你的镇民会冒着生命危险在荒地上向过路的车队讨水喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这口水井是我祖父早年间花费重金在后院打的私井，一直以来都是家族专用的取水处，平常也没有和旁人分享过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不是平常的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我作为一镇之长，情势危急的时候自然不能只顾自己，去年我就把这口井开放给镇民使用了，不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，井水有限，越用越少，自然......是价高者得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"价格高到一坛浑水五个金币吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"（捻死桌子上的一只飞虫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这里可是沙漠，有什么东西能比水更珍贵呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（这吃相真是难看。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"我听秘书报告，说二位前来本镇的目的只是打一口水井？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，动土和打井都不是小事，所以我们特地前来拜访此地长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这虽然是造福本镇的大好事，二位愿意为本镇尽心尽力，我作为镇长自然无比感激，但是，很遗憾，我不能给你们打井的许可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？你都说了这是好事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"那首《偷月亮的女人》，你们听过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡的每一个人都听过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这个镇子的历史可以追溯到一百年前，一位探险家来到这里建立了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"在他的手札中曾记录，那颗大如星斗的宝石就埋藏在我们的脚下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说传言不可考，但是作为镇长，守护那颗宝石不受异乡人的染指是我们代代相传的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其呢，是那些一来就要在我们的土地上大行挖掘之事的异乡人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为只有傻瓜才会相信这样的故事是真实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"相信和真实有关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔，我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐等等我，别走那么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，你、你还好吗？！是刚刚的水有问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，如果井水变浑黄，多是因为里面铁锰含量超标，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，呕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没事。但是刚刚的水喝不出任何的铁腥味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"难道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水里的杂质......是被掺进去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"*萨尔贡粗口*，那你也没必要真的去喝啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，那口井一定被看得很死，我只能用这种方法证实我的猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在我们要怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先找到可以打井的泉眼再说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔，你体力不够啊，我们才走了不到半天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼，是不到半天，可是、可是沙地里走路实在是太费力气了，一脚深一脚浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘了你和我不一样......你要喝水吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，让我歇歇就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过来，我们再坚持走一段，到了前面的岩石后面再休息，太阳直射下，你体内的水分会很快流失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可......你不是不喜欢和别人同打一把伞吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话，快过来，你难道想继续晒着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......好，没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"还是算了吧，图耶小姐你看起来不是很舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快来，有什么事过去再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚咕咚——差点没渴死我。图耶小姐，走了这么长时间，你不坐下来休息一会儿吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个地方三面环山，是撮箕口，有利于地下水储水，而且有荫蔽，打了井更容易储水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你会的东西也太多了，这些关于打井的知识，你都是在哪里学到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族培养的，我们家的每一个人都会接受在沙漠中生存的训练，寻找水资源是必修的课程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么家族啊，怎么人人都要学这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在沙漠中辗转谋生的商旅世家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是那个由丰蹄家族掌控的贸易公司......我早该想到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别讲得那么夸张，我父母这一支已经在家族血脉的边缘了，没想到那么远了，还是逃不过那些老头子的家规。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，多学些东西总不是坏事，保不准哪一天就派上用场了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，找到了......喂，纳吉尔，接好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！这是什么东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怕什么，它又不咬人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"因为它长得实在是......太丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别看这虫子长得丑，没有它的帮助，我们族人早就黄沙没过头顶了。这里有它在，说明我们离泉眼不远了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔，帮我一个忙，翻翻这些石头，看看底下有没有长着一些灰黄色的草，叶子很细很小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，让我找找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了！还真的有啊......然后呢，图耶小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我来看看，它的根......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它北边的根系更发达，我们去那里看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为这里除了我们没有人来的，怎么全被高高低低的木桩围起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是一片墓地，那不是木桩，是墓碑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实，细看下来这些木桩上都刻着字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“这里埋葬着慈爱的父亲，忠诚的丈夫和勇敢的战士——布里斯·萨伊丁·努曼哈德”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“......可爱的女儿......丽琪亚·努曼哈德”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“智慧的老者......引路人......穆塔里·努曼哈德”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这里埋葬的是一个姓努曼哈德的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"努曼哈德......怎么看起来这么眼熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么一说我也觉得，好像在哪里见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，我想起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个混蛋镇长府邸里有一张家族挂毯，那上面的姓氏正是努曼哈德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒吸一口气）那岂不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我们要找的泉眼就在那个家伙祖先的埋骨之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"*萨尔贡粗口*"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想，实在不行就在这里强行打一口井，那混球能拿我们怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来......是我想得太简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（双手抓紧额前的头发）别看我，我也没什么好办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然......要不然就算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，图耶小姐，你还记得我吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，记得，女士，你还需要水吗？我这里还有，一会儿拿给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）不是，我是来还你水袋的，谢谢你当时的慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"看你们这满面愁容的样子，打井的事情想必很不顺利吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不情愿地点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，图耶小姐，离开这里吧，有那个人在，你们什么都做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"不信你们去看那面墙上贴的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这人头攒动的，啥也看不到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大家麻烦让一让，让我过去下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"“重申......本镇严禁未经允许私自打井，参与动工者鞭二十，从井中取水者鞭十。”这个杀千刀的畜生他怎么敢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我简直想撬开他的胸膛看看里面到底装了些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜里面独独找不到一颗良心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人在这个地方横征暴敛，就是为了早日攒够一笔钱献给王酋，好从这里调离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"他汲汲营营半辈子，怎么会放任别人挡了他的财路与仕途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是这里的人，他拿你们没办法，可生活在这里的人，哪一个不是受他挟制呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙切齿）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"我先回去了，图耶小姐，你也早点休息吧，太阳就快要落山了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的孩子，她怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我把她和祖母埋在一起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰头土脸的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对，还是及时最重要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（捏捏自己的眉头）纳吉尔，我们别无选择了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摘下自己脖子上挂的吊坠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔，这块石头给你，帮我办一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，图耶小姐，我不需要你给我报酬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是报酬，我需要你帮我把它埋在我们昨天去的地方，记得去掉挂绳和银圈， 再在上面凿出一些痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这颗宝石价格昂贵，图耶小姐你这是做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贪得无厌之人终将自掘坟墓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为什么要一早就等在这里，图耶小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看戏不迟到是最基本的礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们登场了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定你没听错吗？那女人找到宝石的地点真的是在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我再三确认过了，先生，没错，就在这里，那女人正是在这里避风时看到的，这颗宝石就被埋在沙地中露出一角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是罕见的东西啊，看来那首诗说的没错，这里的地下真的埋藏着值钱货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"星斗大的宝石啊，要是献给王酋，您肯定能进禄加官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你铲子带了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"带了带了，不过先生，我们为什么不多叫几个人，我们两个人要挖到什么时候去啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"混账，这种刨自己祖坟的事情说出去我的脸面还要不要了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，还是越少人知道越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"还不快动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，好好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"请原谅我，父亲母亲，我会感激你们的庇佑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"请原谅我，祖父祖母，我会感激你们的庇佑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳，这扬起来的沙尘怎么是白的，呸呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你有挖到什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"没有啊，这大坑小坑的，里面没一个有东西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"废物，滚开，让我来，我就不信邪了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"（狠狠一铲子杵下去。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"起先，只是一股混杂气泡的泥浆，从铲尖下的沙土中涌出。\n很快，更多积蓄在地下的泉水冲破了地表，在沙地上开出一朵又一朵水花，边缘泛着白沫，浸润了沙粒。\n镇长脚下的沙土开始不断下陷，秘书感觉不妙，迅速推开还未回过神的镇长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瞬间，汹涌的泉水喷薄而出，一道水柱笔直射向高处，冲垮了整片墓园。\n几米高的水帘将水珠洒回地面，凝聚成一条清澈的溪流，越过沙丘，流向远处的小镇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"水，怎么只有水！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"东西呢？！宝石呢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信，你，你去接着挖！快去！给我挖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"镇长，去不得啊，去了是要被淹死的啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么声音？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是镇民的欢呼声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，难怪你要问，他们的声音是传不到你的耳朵里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"（惊疑地打量着图耶）你来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来恭喜你，镇长先生，要知道，沙漠中可没有什么宝藏比水更珍贵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"（狼狈地抹去脸上的水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得偿所愿，您一定很满意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你，是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢打我！是不是那些穷鬼让你来的！是不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会放过他们的！有一个算一个，谁也别想好过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你这气急败坏的样子，经年累月做一个梦，一夕支离破碎，滋味好不好呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如我来给你指条明路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不惜毁坏祖先的坟墓，也要为镇民取水，传出去也是大功一件，上报给王酋，镇长先生，你想调到哪里都不是问题啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过就算你去再富庶的地方，混得再有头脸，终其一生，也就是一只吸血的臭虫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为你发了一封请功的信件，不到一个月，王酋的使节应该就要来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还想离开这里，我劝你抓住机会，善待这里的镇民，想个办法好好立些贤名吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你最后的机会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好秘书，还不扶你的镇长离开，你看他一句话都说不出来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，纳吉尔，我们要做的事情已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图耶","speakerId":"avg_402_tuye_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳吉尔？你怎么还不跟上来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"图耶小姐，你看彩虹，阳光下有一片彩虹出现了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
